          text: 'Episode 5: When Strength Was Not Enough',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 4726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 13294),
          text:
              'The final morning of Strength, Skills and Service Week arrived with more excitement than any of the previous days.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 13294),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 17974),
          text: 'The school courtyard had been turned into an exhibition area.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17974),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 28982),
          text:
              'Team Amanah’s bridge stood on one table, their community-centre model on another, and photographs from the service challenge had been placed on a display board nearby.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 28982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37102),
          text:
              'By lunchtime, parents, teachers and students would walk through the courtyard before the final trophy was announced.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44342),
          text:
              'Akhlaq stood in front of their display with his hands on his hips and said that it looked excellent.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44342),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44822),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 45541),
          text: '“Alhamdulillah, it does.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 45541),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 51950),
          text:
              'Mohsin pressed gently against the base of their tall community-centre model and said it was strong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52518),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 57950),
          text:
              'Mohsina looked towards the two decorative towers and asked whether it was strong enough.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58568),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 60950),
          text: 'Mohsin replied confidently that it was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64918),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67798),
          text: 'Just then, Ms. Sana approached.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67798),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74198),
          text:
              'A steady breeze had begun moving through the courtyard, lifting the corners of some posters.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74198),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 81318),
          text:
              'She checked several displays and asked the teams to make sure that nothing tall or lightweight could fall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81318),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 88726),
          text:
              'When she reached Team Amanah’s table, she examined their model and suggested securing the towers more firmly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89270),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 92166),
          text: 'Mohsin tested the base and said they were fine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 92166),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99886),
          text:
              'Ms. Sana pointed out that the wind was getting stronger and advised them to reinforce it with tape and support sticks.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99886),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103166),
          text: 'After she moved away, Imaan reached for the tape.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 103625),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108294),
          text:
              'Akhlaq asked whether they really needed to rebuild part of it now.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112614),
          text: 'Mohsin pressed the model once more and called it solid.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113144),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 117294),
          text:
              'Mohsina reminded them that Ms. Sana had told them to strengthen it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 117767),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122174),
          text:
              'Akhlaq replied that she thought they should, while they thought it was fine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122174),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124814),
          text: 'The model really did look strong, so they left it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 124822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128822),
          text: 'The exhibition began shortly before midday.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131822),
          text: 'Children moved from table to table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138822),
          text:
              'Parents admired the projects, and teachers asked questions about what each team had learned during the week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141822),
          text: 'Team Amanah received plenty of praise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141822),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143822),
          text: 'One parent admired their bridge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144790),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148110),
          text: 'Another complimented the community-centre model.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148110),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153510),
          text:
              'A younger student pointed at the towers and whispered that theirs was the biggest.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153510),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 159550),
          text:
              'Akhlaq heard him, smiled, then caught himself and quietly said, “Alhamdulillah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160222),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162350),
          text: 'Mohsina noticed and smiled too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162350),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164430),
          text: 'Perhaps they really had changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164758),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168258),
          text: 'The wind, however, continued to grow stronger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168258),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171558),
          text: 'One paper sign blew across the courtyard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174758),
          text: 'Several teams began holding down their displays.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175143),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179758),
          text:
              'Imaan looked towards their model and suggested securing it now.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180298),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184758),
          text:
              'Mohsin glanced at the crowd and said the presentation started in five minutes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185265),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190566),
          text:
              'Akhlaq worried that taping it now would make it look as if something were wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191371),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192846),
          text: 'Mohsina stared at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192846),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193185),
          text: '“So?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194202),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195726),
          text: 'Akhlaq hesitated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199526),
          text: 'That answer sounded worse once it had left his mouth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205932),
          text:
              'Before he could say anything else, a sudden gust of wind swept through the courtyard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205932),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 208099),
          text: 'The display cloth lifted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 208099),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210471),
          text: 'One of their signs fell flat.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210471),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213929),
          text: 'Then the taller tower on their model moved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214487),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 217369),
          text: 'Mohsin reached towards it, but he was too late.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217369),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224454),
          text:
              'The tower leaned sideways, pulled part of the upper structure with it and fell onto the empty section of the table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224662),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227294),
          text: 'Everyone nearby stepped back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227294),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 228662),
          text: 'Nobody was hurt.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 228662),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232262),
          text: 'For a few seconds, Team Amanah simply stared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232262),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234862),
          text: 'Their beautiful model was damaged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 235490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237462),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at the fallen tower.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237462),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239462),
          text: '“But it was strong.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240062),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243662),
          text: 'Mohsina replied quietly, “Not strong enough for this.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244630),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249830),
          text:
              'Ms. Sana came over, checked that everyone was safe and helped move the loose pieces away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249830),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252070),
          text: 'She did not scold them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255470),
          text: 'Akhlaq admitted that they should have listened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255938),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260990),
          text:
              'Mohsin said he had thought that because he tested it with his hand, he knew.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261290),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270198),
          text:
              'Imaan looked at the unused support sticks and said they had everything they needed to strengthen it; they had simply thought they did not need to.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270198),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277078),
          text:
              'A familiar voice behind them said, “Sometimes the most dangerous words are not ‘I cannot.’',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 280078),
          text: 'They are ‘nothing can happen to me.’”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281953),
          text: 'They turned and saw Zameer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282538),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284598),
          text: 'He first asked whether everyone was all right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285059),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290381),
          text:
              'When they said yes, he reminded them that a model could be repaired.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 294762),
          text:
              'Akhlaq said that it had been supposed to be their best display.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295176),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 300561),
          text:
              'Zameer replied that it might now have given them the most important lesson of the week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 300975),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304566),
          text:
              'Mohsin looked at the fallen tower and asked whether this was about ‘Ad.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315326),
          text:
              'Zameer nodded, but immediately clarified that their tower had fallen because of an ordinary gust of wind and because it had not been secured properly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315326),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 322534),
          text:
              'This was not a punishment from Allah, and they should not compare a school model falling with what happened to the people of ‘Ad.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 322692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330102),
          text:
              'It could simply help them understand that feeling strong did not mean having no limits.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 330543),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 340702),
          text:
              'Zameer reminded them that Hud (A.S.) had called his people to worship Allah alone, reminded them of Allah’s favours and warned them against arrogance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 340702),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344182),
          text: 'Yet many of them continued to reject him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 344182),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 352350),
          text:
              'They had become so impressed with their strength that the Qur’an records their boast: “Who is stronger than us in might?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 352942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 355310),
          text: 'Mohsin remembered Episode One.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 355310),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 358350),
          text: 'The words no longer sounded impressive.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 358350),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 360550),
          text: 'They sounded dangerous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 360986),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363270),
          text: 'Imaan asked what happened next.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363685),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 367029),
          text: 'Zameer explained that eventually Allah’s decree came.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 367029),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 373638),
          text:
              'The Qur’an describes how the people of ‘Ad saw something approaching like a cloud towards their valleys.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 374438),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 376776),
          text: 'They thought it was bringing rain.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377277),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 378278),
          text: 'Mohsina was surprised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379354),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 383053),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that they had misunderstood what they were seeing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 383053),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 386406),
          text: 'It was the punishment they had demanded impatiently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 386406),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 393406),
          text:
              'The punishment came through a tremendously powerful, bitter wind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 393406),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 401406),
          text:
              'In another Qur’anic passage, Allah tells us that it continued against them for seven nights and eight days.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 401890),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 406618),
          text:
              'Mohsin looked towards the trees moving in the courtyard breeze.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 406618),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 412812),
          text:
              'The people of ‘Ad had been proud of their strength, yet they could not stop the wind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 412812),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417814),
          text: 'No worldly strength could protect them from Allah’s decree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 418290),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 423904),
          text:
              'Zameer continued that Hud (A.S.) had never taught them that strength was useless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 423904),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 427813),
          text:
              'He taught them that their strength was not independent of Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 428507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 430502),
          text: 'Imaan understood the difference.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 431062),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 439142),
          text:
              'It was one thing to say, “Allah gave us strength,” and another to say, “Our strength means we do not need Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 440068),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 444182),
          text:
              'Mohsin asked what happened to Hud (A.S.) and the people who believed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 444873),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 453310),
          text:
              'Zameer told them that the Qur’an says Allah saved Hud (A.S.) and those who believed with him by His mercy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 453310),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 455150),
          text: 'Akhlaq noticed the wording.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 455150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 463310),
          text:
              'They had not been saved because they were physically stronger, because their buildings were better or because they had more people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 464278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 467278),
          text: 'They were saved by Allah’s mercy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 467278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 471278),
          text: 'The children remembered the lessons of the entire week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 471278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 474278),
          text: 'Strength had not been the problem.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 474278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 477278),
          text: 'Achievement had not been the problem.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 477278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 480278),
          text: 'Building had not been the problem.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 480278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 483278),
          text: 'Leadership had not been the problem.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 484246),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 489206),
          text:
              'The problem began when blessings were turned into evidence of superiority and independence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 489865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 495606),
          text:
              'Mohsina said that the people of ‘Ad had gifts, but the gifts had not made them humble.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 496089),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 496669),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 496669),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 506854),
          text:
              'A blessing could bring a person closer to Allah through gratitude, or become a test when it made the person admire themselves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 507313),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 510894),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked down and asked what he should do if he won.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 511504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 513454),
          text: 'Zameer said to thank Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 513454),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 517174),
          text: 'If he lost, he should still thank Allah and learn.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 517174),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 520694),
          text: 'If he was strong, he should use the strength well.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 520694),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 524134),
          text:
              'If he was weak at something, he should learn without feeling worthless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 524748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 529182),
          text:
              'Mohsin added that if someone else was weaker, he should help them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 529483),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 536182),
          text:
              'Imaan said that if they built something good, they could enjoy it without needing another person’s work to look bad.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 536578),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 542182),
          text:
              'Mohsina added that if someone gave them good advice, they should not ignore it just because they were confident.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 544730),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 549150),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked at the fallen tower and said that one felt unnecessarily specific.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 549150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 551150),
          text: 'Everyone laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 551150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 555150),
          text: 'The trophy announcement took place later that afternoon.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 555150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 560150),
          text:
              'Team Amanah stood with the other teams while Ms. Sana reviewed the week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 560150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 568878),
          text:
              'She praised not only winning, but teamwork, improvement, service, honesty and the way students had responded to mistakes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 568878),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 571838),
          text: 'Then she announced the overall result.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 571838),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 573798),
          text: 'Team Amanah had won.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 573798),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 579798),
          text:
              'For half a second, Akhlaq’s mouth opened as if a huge celebration was about to come out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 579798),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 582838),
          text: 'Then he looked at Mohsin, Imaan and Mohsina.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 582838),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 584086),
          text: 'Together they smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 584086),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 587426),
          text: '“Alhamdulillah,” Akhlaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 587426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 591846),
          text:
              'This time the words did not feel like something they had remembered to say.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 591846),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 593346),
          text: 'They meant them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 593346),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 602346),
          text:
              'When the trophy was handed to them, Akhlaq held it for a few seconds and then passed it to the younger children who had worked with them during the service challenge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 602346),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 605571),
          text: 'One of them said that they had not won the competition.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 606329),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 606979),
          text: 'Akhlaq smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 606979),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 609254),
          text: '“You helped us learn how to.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 609254),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 617733),
          text:
              'Later, as the children packed up their damaged model, Mohsin decided not to throw away the fallen tower.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 618125),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 620251),
          text: 'Imaan asked what he was doing with it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 620251),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 628022),
          text:
              'He said he was keeping it as a reminder that being strong and being unstoppable were not the same thing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 628408),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 636022),
          text:
              'Imaan added that being successful and being independent of Allah were definitely not the same thing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 636431),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 640022),
          text: 'Akhlaq picked up the trophy and asked what real strength was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 640448),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 643990),
          text: 'Zameer, who had returned to say goodbye, heard the question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 643990),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 651990),
          text:
              '“Real strength,” he said, “is receiving Allah’s blessings without allowing them to make you forget Him.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 651990),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 659990),
          text:
              'The children looked at the trophy, the repaired bridge, the damaged tower and the younger students helping pack the hall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 659990),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 664621),
          text:
              'They had begun the week wanting to prove that nobody could beat them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 664621),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 668847),
          text: 'They finished it understanding something far more valuable.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 668847),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 677105),
          text:
              'There would always be someone stronger, faster or cleverer, and even the greatest human strength had limits.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 677105),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 680028),
          text: 'Humility did not make a person smaller.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 680028),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 683878),
          text: 'It taught them where their strength truly came from.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 683926),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 688138),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Turn Pride into Gratitude',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 688138),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 700858),
          text:
              'Think of one blessing that sometimes makes you feel proud: your intelligence, strength, appearance, possessions, marks, popularity, family, talent or achievements.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 700858),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 702292),
          text: 'Say: “Alhamdulillah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 702292),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 709014),
          text:
              'Allah gave me this blessing, and I am responsible for how I use it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 709014),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 712934),
          text: 'Then use that blessing in one way that benefits someone else.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 712934),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 714414),
          text: 'Level-Up',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 714414),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 723214),
          text:
              'When you succeed, practise three steps: thank Allah, appreciate the people who helped you, and ask how you can use the success responsibly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 723862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 726222),
          text: 'Confidence says, “I can try.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 727000),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 728942),
          text: 'Arrogance says, “I cannot fall.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 728942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 733302),
          text: 'Humility says, “Whatever strength I have is from Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 733302),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 735011),
          text: 'End of Hazrat Hud (A.S.) Series',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 735942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 738102),
          text: 'The five lessons of the journey:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 738102),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 743830),
          text:
              'Episode 1 — Nobody Can Beat Us: Strength is a blessing, not proof of superiority.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 743830),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 751790),
          text:
              'Episode 2 — Look What We Built: Achievement should create excellence, not comparison.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 751790),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 759150),
          text:
              'Episode 3 — Who Gave You All This?: Gratitude remembers what we received as well as what we achieved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 759150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 768678),
          text:
              'Episode 4 — Strong Enough to Be Kind: Real strength protects, teaches and serves instead of dominating.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 768678),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 775997),
          text:
              'Episode 5 — When Strength Was Not Enough: No human strength makes us independent of Allah.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
